<title>UK: Inchcape buys S. Africa ship agency Voigt.</title>
<headline>Inchcape buys S. Africa ship agency Voigt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British conglomerate Inchcape Plc said on Wednesday its shipping services unit bought South Africa's Voigt Shipping (Pty) Ltd for a &quot;nominal&quot; amount.</p>
<p>Voigt, a specialist in key bulk commodities, had turnover of 1.0 million stg and net assets of 50,000 stg, Inchcape said in a statement. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
